+ *    resolution, because an earlier revision of this batch shipped the wrong
+ *    story (`params.width = 2` giving the catalog's 2-bit decoder).
+ *  * LEVEL 27 HAS AN AUTHORED INSTRUCTION SET. The source says only "用或门和非门
